{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに沢山の方々に\n『おめでとう』\nを言っていただけるなんて想像もしてなかったから...ビックリです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、嬉しかったです★"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスも言ってもらえて、\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも祝ってくれて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば\nいくちゃん(生田えりかちゃん)が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんとまあやでジュース買いに行ってたら抱きついてきて、抱きついたまま\n生田"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあやおめでとー！』\n和田"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ありがとー(*^^*)ちょっと買えないから離してー笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『私とジュースどっちがすきなの！？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あはは(*^^*)ジュースだよーっ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとか言ったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな12時に沢山のMAILくれたり。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃん(西野七瀬ちゃん)は泊まりにきて、八つ橋をくれたのっ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや八つ橋だいすきだからめっちゃ嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月ちゃんには"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『40歳になってもまあやだろうなぁ』\nとか言って話してた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに若月ちゃんが一番にオメデトウ言ってくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん(橋本ななみちゃん)も\n『"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happybirthdaytoyou〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nって歌ってくれたり、そしたらさゆりん(松村さゆりちゃん)とかも歌い出してくれて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょんもプレゼントくれたり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1、5(いちご)ケーキも美味しかったです♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部書いたら書ききれないけど、皆に祝ってもらえて嬉しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族には会えないけど、メンバーや乃木坂familyの皆が今のまあやには家族みたいな大切な存在です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついこの前まで\n『中学1年生13歳の』\nって自己紹介してたのに......もう\n『中学3年生15歳のっ』\nって言うようになっちゃった..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15歳になったから、お薬の量とか......栄養ドリンクとか...飲めるようになって大人の気分ですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/26/8358952/0015.gif","alt